<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - At Home rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - At Home rated buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said analyst Alan Braverman initiated coverage of At Home Corp with a buy rating, and set an 18-month price target of $28.50.</p>
<p>Shares jumped three to 21-5/8.</p>
</text>
